# Allowlist: ignore everything at root by default, only .claude/ is tracked.
# This repo exists solely to publish neo/.claude/ (universal Claude Code
# config, shared across all subfolder projects, each of which has its own
# independent git repo that this root repo must never see or touch).
/*
!/.claude
!/.gitignore
!/README.md

# Inside .claude/, ignore local-only settings that shouldn't be published.
.claude/settings.local.json
